models/face_landmarks.onnx
    MediaPipe's Face Mesh V2 face-landmark model (model card "MediaPipe
    Face Mesh V2", September 15, 2022): face_landmarks_detector.tflite
    from the MediaPipe Face Landmarker bundle face_landmarker.task,
    float16, version 1.
    Changed: converted from TensorFlow Lite to ONNX with tf2onnx 1.17.0,
    which also stores the float16 weights as float32 (same values).

src/canonical.rs (CANONICAL_FACE)
    The vertex positions of MediaPipe's canonical face model,
    mediapipe/modules/face_geometry/data/canonical_face_model.obj.
    Changed: only the 468 vertex positions are kept, their y and z
    coordinates are negated, and each value is rounded to five
    significant digits.

Sources, checksums and what is not known about them: models/README.md.
